From 6f8a0aff6325dae2ea3ec45e352457580de83e6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Yao <hao.yao@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:11:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] IPU7 release for iot on 2026-11-13

Signed-off-by: Hao Yao <hao.yao@intel.com>
---
